d Golden Man triggers prompt widget.\n\nHold-to-activate mechanic tied to countdown timer.\n\nIf complete:\n\nPlay dissolve FX on avatar and Golden Man\n\nTrigger level transition (Load Narrative Realm)\n\nPlayer Resistance Branches\nRefusal to Enter a Door:\n\nTimer triggers subtle decay in the room's structure.\n\nVoice of the Intelligence:\n\n\"Even indecision is a choice. Will you walk, or turn back again?\"\n\nAfter multiple refusals, the chamber dims and auto-teleports the player to their least-used avatar’s door.\n\nAttempting Violence in Mirror Room or Memory Arena:\n\nAction is allowed visually but has no effect.\n\nAudio cue: hollow echoes of their weapon.\n\nGuide remarks:\n\n\"You still believe this is something to fight. It isn’t.\"\n\nIf repeated, reflections of the player appear, mimicking their movements.\n\nCodex / Lore Unlocks (Per Avatar)\nNero – The Weaver\n\nEntry: “The Illusion of Control”\n\nQuotes about truth, power, and the unseen nature of karma.\n\nJessica – The Mirror\n\nEntry: “What You See Is You”\n\nLore traces shame, beauty, and the seduction of image.\n\nJack – The Judge\n\nEntry: “Justice Beyond Judgment”\n\nCodex includes echoes of false arrests and internal tribunal logs.\n\nFloyd – The Warrior\n\nEntry: “Strength Without Strike”\n\nNotes include his final matches and reflections on fear.\n\nCodex entries unlock progressively as players pass key trials.\n\nIntegration Outcome Rewards (123:we-Inspired)\nTiered Integration System – Echoing the 123:we Framework\n\nLevel 1 – First Glimpse (Initiation)\n\nReward: Aura of Embers (subtle golden glow in darkness)\n\nEffect: Slight passive regeneration when standing still\n\nLore: Unlocks quote: “You have seen yourself… for a moment.”\n\nLevel 2 – Deepening Mirror (Intuition)\n\nReward: Mirror Charm (visual accessory reflecting chosen avatar)\n\nEffect: Unique passive buff depending on avatar:\n\nNero: increased clarity during fog effects\n\nJessica: heightened detection of secrets\n\nJack